WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.601 --> 00:00:07.940
1. In Manage hosting, open Mailboxes and click New mailbox.

2
00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:21.201
2. Enter the name and a strong password, then click Create.

3
00:00:21.201 --> 00:00:25.436
3. Click Set up on device next to the new mailbox.

4
00:00:25.436 --> 00:00:37.465
4. Pick your app: iPhone gets a one-tap profile, Android and Outlook get exact server settings.
